# NusaShell code owners. The owner below is requested as a reviewer on every
# pull request that touches the matching paths. When the project grows more
# contributors, add them under the area they own.
#
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
